# StreamClip — Figma Design System Rules

Agent reference for translating Figma designs into StreamClip's Next.js frontend.
Figma MCP: use `get_design_context` for UI mocks; existing FigJam links are architecture-only (see `docs/design/FIGMA_LINKS.md`).

**No Figma Code Connect** is configured in this repo.

---

## 1. Token Definitions

### Source files

| Token type | Primary source |
|------------|----------------|
| CSS variables | `web/app/globals.css` (`:root` + `.dark`) |
| Tailwind mapping | `web/tailwind.config.ts` |
| Semantic color maps | `web/lib/utils/format.ts` (`emotionColors`, `statusColors`) |
| Help copy | `web/lib/help/legends.ts` |

### Color format

All theme colors use **HSL components without `hsl()` wrapper** in CSS variables, consumed as `hsl(var(--token))` in Tailwind:

```css
/* web/app/globals.css */
:root {
  --primary: 199 89% 48%;        /* sky blue — brand accent */
  --background: 0 0% 100%;
  --foreground: 220 20% 6%;
  --radius: 0.625rem;            /* 10px base radius */
  --sky: 199 89% 48%;
  --silver: 220 10% 72%;
}
.dark {
  --background: 220 18% 4%;
  --foreground: 0 0% 98%;
  --card: 220 12% 11%;
  --primary: 199 89% 48%;
}
```

```ts
// web/tailwind.config.ts — map to Tailwind utilities
colors: {
  primary: { DEFAULT: "hsl(var(--primary))", foreground: "hsl(var(--primary-foreground))" },
  sky: { DEFAULT: "hsl(var(--sky))", 400: "#38bdf8" },
  silver: "hsl(var(--silver))",
}
```

### Figma → code transforms

| Figma intent | Implementation |
|--------------|------------------|
| Brand / CTA blue | `text-sky-400`, `bg-primary`, `border-sky-400/30`, `bg-sky-400/10` |
| Muted text | `text-muted-foreground` |
| Card surface | `bg-card` or `.glossy-surface` |
| Borders on dark UI | `border-white/10`, `border-border/60` |
| Success / error | `text-emerald-400`, `text-red-400` with `/10` bg tints |
| Emotion badges | `emotionColors[emotion]` from `format.ts` |
| Job status badges | `statusColors[status]` from `format.ts` |

### Typography

```tsx
// web/app/layout.tsx
const inter = Inter({ subsets: ["latin"], variable: "--font-sans", weight: ["400", "500"] });
// <body className={`${inter.variable} font-sans antialiased`}>
```

Hero pages: `text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight` (`web/app/page.tsx`).

Section labels: `text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground` (`SectionLegend`).

Mono corner tags (clip rank/score): `text-xs font-mono font-medium`.

### Spacing & radius

- Base radius: `--radius: 0.625rem` → Tailwind `rounded-lg` = `var(--radius)`.
- Container: `center: true`, `padding: "2rem"`, `screens: { "2xl": "1400px" }`.
- Card padding: `p-6`; form sections `space-y-4`; page sections `space-y-10`.

### Motion

- `.animate-fade-in` — 0.25s ease-out
- `.skeleton` — shimmer loading
- `.progress-bar` — respects `prefers-reduced-motion`

