## 2. Component Library

### Directory structure (`web/components/`)

```
ui/           — Primitives (Button, Card, form controls, Tooltip, HelpTip)
auth/         — auth-form, auth-panel, claim-device-modal
clips/        — clip-card, clip-editor, approval, destinations drawer
jobs/         — create-job-form, jobs-list, live-progress, filters
vault/        — vault-clip-grid, vault-destinations-drawer
distribution/ — queue, connections, oauth toasts, pro-gate modal
settings/     — oauth-setup-wizard, license-panel
upload/       — direct-upload (MinIO presigned PUT)
layout/       — header-nav, header-nav-wrapper
onboarding/   — onboarding-wizard
providers/    — client-providers, toast, tooltip, token-refresh
```

### Architecture

- **shadcn-inspired, manually maintained** — Radix + CVA + `cn()`.
- **No `components.json`**, no Storybook.

### UI primitives (`web/components/ui/`)

| Component | File | Notes |
|-----------|------|-------|
| `Button` | `button.tsx` | CVA variants; optional `tooltip` prop |
| `Card` | `card.tsx` | Uses `glossy-surface` by default |
| `Input`, `Label`, `Select`, `Badge`, `Progress` | `form.tsx` | Native `<select>` |
| `Tooltip` | `tooltip.tsx` | Radix tooltip |
| `HelpTip`, `LabelWithTip` | `help-tip.tsx` | Domain help pattern |
| `SectionLegend` | `section-legend.tsx` | Uppercase section headers |

### Feature patterns

```tsx
// 9:16 clip preview
<div style={{ aspectRatio: "9/16" }} className="relative bg-black">
  <video src={clip.download_url} playsInline />
</div>

// Right drawer
className="fixed right-0 top-0 z-50 h-full max-w-md glossy-surface border-l animate-fade-in"
```

### Client vs server

- Pages: Server Components; fetch server-side.
- Interactive: `"use client"` components.
- Mutations: Server Actions in `web/app/actions/`.
- Providers: `ClientProviders` in layout.

